  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>z</mi></math> and <math><mi>w</mi></math> are complex numbers satisfying <math><mover accent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mover accent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>amp</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>amp</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>w</mi></mfenced></math> is equal to (where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>amp</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>w</mi></mfenced><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>)"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
